# LOGO INSTRUCTIONS
# =================
# 
# Place your logo file in this directory (public/)
# 
# Supported formats: .png, .svg, .jpg, .jpeg, .webp
# 
# Name your file one of these:
#   - logo.png (recommended)
#   - logo.svg
#   - logo.jpg
#   - logo.webp
#
# The Logo component will automatically use it once you place it here.
# 
# If your logo has a different name, update the `logoSrc` variable in:
#   app/components/Logo.tsx
